line payments as a service; TimePay Cash, which enables customers to withdraw cash; risk intelligence decisioning platform for fraud detection and management in real-time payments; and Merchant Bizz for digital transactions. In addition, the company offers business monitoring solution; and anti-money laundering, a web-based platform that detects anti-money laundering and financial fraud. Network People Services Technologies Limited was incorporated in 2013 and is based in Thane, India."}}